[110.669, "o", "> **Determinism Verification:** The entire live multi-process system is 100% bitwise deterministic across identical PRNG seeds. Because time progress is governed by explicit `SimClock` ticks and state polling/proposals use synchronous framing over local TCP streams, OS process scheduling jitter does not corrupt logical state sequencing. Every arm selection and telemetry reward metric matches with 0.0000 variance across runs.\r\n"]
